WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:31.166
In this verse,

2
00:00:31.166 --> 00:00:32.208
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:34.750
describes in detail about His pure devotees,

4
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.708
explaining

5
00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:38.041
how they worship Him

6
00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:40.500
with their whole heart.

7
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.791
As mentioned in the previous verse,

8
00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:45.166
the previous verse

9
00:00:45.166 --> 00:00:48.500
explained the foundational
principles of devotion.

10
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.500
Now this verse offers a practical glimpse

11
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.583
into the life of a devotee.

12
00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:55.916
It shows

13
00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:59.041
what the life of such a devotee is like –

14
00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:02.083
one who is completely absorbed in devotion,

15
00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:04.791
whose thoughts, actions, and speech

16
00:01:04.791 --> 00:01:08.166
all revolve around Lord Krishna.

17
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:11.000
This verse sheds light on remembering Lord Krishna,

18
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.000
singing His glories,

19
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.291
and being absorbed in His presence,

20
00:01:15.291 --> 00:01:16.916
and the joy

21
00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:20.666
and contentment that come from this.

22
00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:27.208
Lord Krishna describes the activities

23
00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.208
of His pure devotees.

24
00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:33.666
'Mach-chittah' – the devotee's mind

25
00:01:33.666 --> 00:01:36.333
is absorbed in Lord Krishna.

26
00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:37.666
Pure devotees

27
00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:40.916
continuously contemplate Lord Krishna.

28
00:01:40.916 --> 00:01:45.166
Their mind naturally draws toward Him.

29
00:01:45.166 --> 00:01:47.750
Just as a traveller finds

30
00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:50.750
comfort and ease upon returning home,

31
00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.500
the devotee's mind,

32
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.125
contemplating Lord Krishna

33
00:01:55.125 --> 00:01:57.958
finds peace and joy.

34
00:01:57.958 --> 00:01:59.166
This absorption

35
00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:00.416
does not just make Lord Krishna

36
00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:02.583
an object of thought,

37
00:02:02.583 --> 00:02:04.000
but makes Him

38
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.875
the very essence of their inner life.

39
00:02:07.875 --> 00:02:11.875
For devotees, Lord Krishna is the eternal shelter,

40
00:02:11.875 --> 00:02:17.541
the anchor amid life's uncertainties.

41
00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:19.791
'Mad-gata-pranah' –

42
00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:20.666
that is,

43
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:24.333
their life is dedicated to Lord Krishna.

44
00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:27.750
Lord Krishna becomes the
very breath of His devotees,

45
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.916
symbolising their complete

46
00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:32.875
dependence on Lord Krishna.

47
00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:34.166
Just as a fish

48
00:02:34.166 --> 00:02:36.625
cannot survive without water,

49
00:02:36.625 --> 00:02:38.583
a pure devotee

50
00:02:38.583 --> 00:02:41.500
cannot live without Lord Krishna.

51
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.375
Every action is imbued

52
00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:47.250
with the desire to serve Lord Krishna.

53
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:51.708
The confidence that comes
from this bond with Lord Krishna

54
00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:53.625
gives the will to live

55
00:02:53.625 --> 00:02:56.500
even greater strength.

56
00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.833
Their surrender is not limited

57
00:02:58.833 --> 00:03:02.958
to grand acts of devotion alone, but enters

58
00:03:02.958 --> 00:03:05.875
every small, daily activity.

59
00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:07.875
They see all their activities

60
00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:10.000
as opportunities to serve

61
00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:14.458
Lord Krishna and to glorify Him.

62
00:03:14.458 --> 00:03:17.416
'Bodhayantah parasparam' –

63
00:03:17.416 --> 00:03:20.208
that is, they love to share

64
00:03:20.208 --> 00:03:21.375
Lord Krishna's glory

65
00:03:21.375 --> 00:03:24.958
with one another.

66
00:03:24.958 --> 00:03:27.625
Devotees find immense joy

67
00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:29.458
in enriching each other's

68
00:03:29.458 --> 00:03:31.916
knowledge of Lord Krishna.

69
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:34.375
They share their experiences

70
00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:35.916
with one another.

71
00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:38.208
They discuss His divine pastimes

72
00:03:38.208 --> 00:03:43.291
and support each other on this spiritual journey.

73
00:03:43.291 --> 00:03:45.125
This mutual sharing

74
00:03:45.125 --> 00:03:47.375
strengthens their devotion

75
00:03:47.375 --> 00:03:48.666
and creates a loving community

76
00:03:48.666 --> 00:03:52.166
centred on Lord Krishna.

77
00:03:52.166 --> 00:03:53.458
Such exchanges

78
00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:55.666
are not ordinary conversations,

79
00:03:55.666 --> 00:03:59.250
but deep spiritual dialogues

80
00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:02.666
that nourish the heart and mind.

81
00:04:02.666 --> 00:04:05.291
Discussions about Lord Krishna

82
00:04:05.291 --> 00:04:10.750
create a bond of divine love among devotees.

83
00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.875
'Kathayantash cha mam' –

84
00:04:12.875 --> 00:04:14.000
that is,

85
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.500
they always love to speak

86
00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.708
about Lord Krishna.

87
00:04:18.708 --> 00:04:22.041
Devotees continuously sing the glories

88
00:04:22.041 --> 00:04:26.083
of His name, form, qualities,
and divine pastimes.

89
00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:28.791
This is not just a duty for them,

90
00:04:28.791 --> 00:04:32.083
but the natural flow of their love.

91
00:04:32.083 --> 00:04:35.000
Through continuous remembrance
of Lord Krishna,

92
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.208
they deepen their relationship with Him.

93
00:04:39.208 --> 00:04:41.875
Taking Lord Krishna's name with devotion,

94
00:04:41.875 --> 00:04:45.291
singing His praise – this itself is worship.

95
00:04:45.291 --> 00:04:48.000
And this constant remembrance of the Name

96
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.708
also gives incomparable joy.

97
00:04:50.708 --> 00:04:53.375
Worship and joy, both together.

98
00:04:53.375 --> 00:04:56.333
Such is the glory of always

99
00:04:56.333 --> 00:04:58.625
remembering Lord Krishna.

100
00:04:58.625 --> 00:05:02.958
'Tushyanti cha ramanti cha' – contentment.

101
00:05:02.958 --> 00:05:08.416
This comes from the present
relationship with Lord Krishna,

102
00:05:08.416 --> 00:05:11.000
from the blessings received from Him,

103
00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.958
and from a feeling of gratitude toward Him.

104
00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:19.250
And delight? That comes from anticipation –

105
00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:24.541
the anticipation of the relationship with Him

106
00:05:24.541 --> 00:05:27.750
growing ever deeper and more profound.

107
00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:31.750
A joy-filled hope keeps the mind uplifted –

108
00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:34.500
'Ah, there are even more

109
00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:38.208
divine experiences of His love yet to come.'

110
00:05:38.208 --> 00:05:41.125
This verse beautifully portrays
the life of a devotee

111
00:05:41.125 --> 00:05:44.250
absorbed in Lord Krishna.

112
00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.333
By fixing the mind on Him,

113
00:05:46.333 --> 00:05:48.291
dedicating life to Him,

114
00:05:48.291 --> 00:05:51.625
and glorifying Him with speech,

115
00:05:51.625 --> 00:05:55.291
the devotee experiences a divine joy

116
00:05:55.291 --> 00:05:58.958
that goes beyond all material pleasures.

117
00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:09.208
In which direction is your mind moving?

118
00:06:09.208 --> 00:06:11.458
When your mind

119
00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:14.375
is still,

120
00:06:14.375 --> 00:06:17.625
ask yourself –

121
00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:20.916
where do my thoughts

122
00:06:20.916 --> 00:06:24.291
naturally flow?

123
00:06:24.291 --> 00:06:27.583
The hidden world of your thoughts,

124
00:06:27.583 --> 00:06:30.916
which others may not see.

125
00:06:30.916 --> 00:06:34.416
But I know.

126
00:06:34.416 --> 00:06:38.708
This shapes your inner reality.

127
00:06:38.708 --> 00:06:39.791
If your mind

128
00:06:39.791 --> 00:06:43.291
remains entangled in material desires,

129
00:06:43.291 --> 00:06:45.208
then in life

130
00:06:45.208 --> 00:06:48.500
a sense of incompleteness, restlessness,

131
00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.958
and dissatisfaction stays.

132
00:06:51.958 --> 00:06:53.750
But when

133
00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:56.541
your thoughts come to rest

134
00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:59.291
on a divine element –

135
00:06:59.291 --> 00:07:03.250
on Me –

136
00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:06.041
your inner being

137
00:07:06.041 --> 00:07:10.416
experiences peace and joy.

138
00:07:10.416 --> 00:07:13.500
True spirituality

139
00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.750
begins with changing

140
00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:20.500
what you think about.

141
00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.791
So keep your mind

142
00:07:23.791 --> 00:07:27.250
away from meaningless

143
00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.083
or disturbing subjects.

144
00:07:30.083 --> 00:07:33.958
Nourish it with elevated thoughts,

145
00:07:33.958 --> 00:07:38.291
uplifting conversations, and eternal truths.

146
00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:40.625
When you engage your mind

147
00:07:40.625 --> 00:07:45.041
in divine thoughts this way,

148
00:07:45.041 --> 00:07:48.208
just as a magnetised needle

149
00:07:48.208 --> 00:07:54.333
always turns to point north,

150
00:07:54.333 --> 00:07:56.083
in the same way,

151
00:07:56.083 --> 00:07:59.250
one who is connected to Me

152
00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:03.291
is always drawn by My attraction

153
00:08:03.291 --> 00:08:06.833
toward Me.

154
00:08:06.833 --> 00:08:09.250
This is the reason

155
00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.541
that material attachment

156
00:08:11.541 --> 00:08:16.041
pulls you toward endless desires,

157
00:08:16.041 --> 00:08:18.750
while spiritual devotion

158
00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:22.500
fills you with fulfilment.

159
00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.500
For example –

160
00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:29.041
constantly being busy on the phone,

161
00:08:29.041 --> 00:08:32.041
lost in countless messages and notifications,

162
00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:35.875
unsettles the mind.

163
00:08:35.875 --> 00:08:39.833
Then if such a person, for a fixed time

164
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:44.541
each day, sets aside the phone

165
00:08:44.541 --> 00:08:49.916
and begins to spend that
time in My remembrance,

166
00:08:49.916 --> 00:08:57.041
a new peace enters their life.

167
00:08:57.041 --> 00:08:59.541
New technology should be used

168
00:08:59.541 --> 00:09:02.291
to add convenience,

169
00:09:02.291 --> 00:09:06.083
not to multiply confusion.

170
00:09:06.083 --> 00:09:07.291
Think about it.

171
00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:13.791
Bonds

172
00:09:13.791 --> 00:09:17.875
or burdens?

173
00:09:17.875 --> 00:09:20.250
In today's families,

174
00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:24.416
even while living under one roof,

175
00:09:24.416 --> 00:09:30.458
the distance between hearts keeps growing.

176
00:09:30.458 --> 00:09:32.416
Phones, films,

177
00:09:32.416 --> 00:09:35.458
television, and various distractions

178
00:09:35.458 --> 00:09:39.958
take up so much of life

179
00:09:39.958 --> 00:09:42.625
that real connection

180
00:09:42.625 --> 00:09:46.500
feels like a distant dream.

181
00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:51.666
Even when conversations happen in the family,

182
00:09:51.666 --> 00:09:53.666
they are often

183
00:09:53.666 --> 00:09:57.416
about surface-level topics –

184
00:09:57.416 --> 00:10:00.000
problems, comparisons,

185
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.666
or disagreements,

186
00:10:02.666 --> 00:10:04.333
which leave everyone

187
00:10:04.333 --> 00:10:08.541
feeling even more tired.

188
00:10:08.541 --> 00:10:11.000
Just as the thirst for water

189
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.666
cannot be quenched by the cold drinks

190
00:10:13.666 --> 00:10:17.208
sold in the market,

191
00:10:17.208 --> 00:10:18.750
in the same way,

192
00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:24.916
such conversations cannot build true closeness.

193
00:10:24.916 --> 00:10:26.958
Imagine

194
00:10:26.958 --> 00:10:30.125
what happens

195
00:10:30.125 --> 00:10:34.500
when a family comes together,

196
00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:38.250
not to argue or complain,

197
00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.583
but to discuss something

198
00:10:41.583 --> 00:10:44.875
uplifting, something higher.

199
00:10:44.875 --> 00:10:48.541
To discuss such a topic.

200
00:10:48.541 --> 00:10:52.250
Then the atmosphere lightens,

201
00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.625
and love

202
00:10:54.625 --> 00:10:57.500
deepens.

203
00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:00.416
So why not bring this kind of change

204
00:11:00.416 --> 00:11:05.541
to your family?

205
00:11:05.541 --> 00:11:07.500
Share something inspiring

206
00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:11.875
or meaningful.

207
00:11:11.875 --> 00:11:13.708
Discuss the deeper

208
00:11:13.708 --> 00:11:17.250
purpose of life.

209
00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.833
Or appreciate

210
00:11:18.833 --> 00:11:22.625
the blessings

211
00:11:22.625 --> 00:11:25.583
you have received.

212
00:11:25.583 --> 00:11:29.041
When your words are centred

213
00:11:29.041 --> 00:11:32.125
on these higher truths,

214
00:11:32.125 --> 00:11:36.500
your home becomes a place

215
00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:41.833
of genuine connection and happiness.

216
00:11:41.833 --> 00:11:44.333
Where the whole family sits

217
00:11:44.333 --> 00:11:49.708
together in divine conversation,

218
00:11:49.708 --> 00:11:51.416
there I Myself

219
00:11:51.416 --> 00:11:55.166
am present.

220
00:11:55.166 --> 00:11:56.750
This is

221
00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.000
the true wealth of a family.

222
00:12:04.791 --> 00:12:08.875
More important than the work

223
00:12:08.875 --> 00:12:13.625
is the spirit behind the work.

224
00:12:13.625 --> 00:12:15.375
From the conversations

225
00:12:15.375 --> 00:12:20.166
that happen at the workplace, it is easy to see

226
00:12:20.166 --> 00:12:22.250
where each person's mind

227
00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:25.500
is focused.

228
00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:28.000
If someone constantly

229
00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:32.125
speaks about office politics, rumours,

230
00:12:32.125 --> 00:12:36.958
or accusations against others,

231
00:12:36.958 --> 00:12:41.875
it shows where their thoughts are anchored.

232
00:12:41.875 --> 00:12:44.000
And the truth is,

233
00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:48.333
what we think about

234
00:12:48.333 --> 00:12:52.500
influences not only our speech, but also

235
00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:56.166
our actions and how

236
00:12:56.166 --> 00:13:00.625
we treat other people.

237
00:13:00.625 --> 00:13:02.500
It is also said –

238
00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:07.125
as we are, so is the world.

239
00:13:07.125 --> 00:13:11.750
When you are inspired by wholesome thoughts,

240
00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.791
you feel encouraged,

241
00:13:13.791 --> 00:13:16.291
you bring clarity,

242
00:13:16.291 --> 00:13:18.208
and your conversations

243
00:13:18.208 --> 00:13:22.250
naturally transform.

244
00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:25.166
You begin to focus on solutions

245
00:13:25.166 --> 00:13:26.458
instead of problems,

246
00:13:26.458 --> 00:13:31.541
instead of politics, on purpose

247
00:13:31.541 --> 00:13:34.333
and on cooperation

248
00:13:34.333 --> 00:13:39.000
instead of conflict.

249
00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.250
As a professional,

250
00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:46.708
your words are a powerful tool.

251
00:13:46.708 --> 00:13:50.666
They can either elevate

252
00:13:50.666 --> 00:13:53.791
the environment around you

253
00:13:53.791 --> 00:13:56.000
or diminish it.

254
00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.541
Therefore,

255
00:13:57.541 --> 00:14:01.708
strive to make your mind knowledgeable.

256
00:14:01.708 --> 00:14:03.666
Your good thoughts

257
00:14:03.666 --> 00:14:07.291
will sweeten your language,

258
00:14:07.291 --> 00:14:09.500
and at the workplace

259
00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:13.166
relationships will flourish.

260
00:14:13.166 --> 00:14:19.250
When work is done with a spirit of surrender,

261
00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:22.125
then even ordinary work

262
00:14:22.125 --> 00:14:25.625
becomes extraordinary.

263
00:14:25.625 --> 00:14:27.166
Think about it.
